msgid ""
"This is a string following the format ``<MAJOR>.<MINOR>``, where ``<MAJOR>`` "
"and ``<MINOR>`` are unpaded numbers and represent the **major** and "
"**minor** components of the version. Versions may be arithmetic compared by "
"intrepreting the version string as a decimal number."
