"other kind of information, such as the ``site-packages`` path. It is the "
"opinion of the PEP authors that information regarding the Python environment "
"should be provided by a separate file, creating the a clear separation "
"between the build details, which should be immutable across any interpreter "
"instance, and details that can change, such as environment details."
